+// NVIDIA compositions (D3D12FrameSynthesizer::quality_bits): bits 16-20; no
+// other pass sets them, and with none set every value below is as before.
+// kQualityLinearInput is no key: the frames are read through an sRGB view
+// (the periphery's or a composed swapchain: values in linear light), where a
